        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1336ad3d-d0a5-4573-820f-f59da83dde3f\",\"review_text\":\"Cry nice\"},{\"review_id\":\"c3b62fe3-6e88-4b4a-93a4-4f9cfedef732\",\"review_text\":\"This app cools you down make you feel better\"},{\"review_id\":\"5918fff8-fcb0-4cb9-a9d5-705b2d4b5fdc\",\"review_text\":\"Satisfied ❤️❤️❤️🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼🌸🌸🌸\"},{\"review_id\":\"b7b08a89-95f1-4285-95a0-8cb92e8da7fc\",\"review_text\":\"I'm sick of this app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b6b2ff53-f70d-4a30-a8db-d8e84d9df0d0\",\"review_text\":\"So many ads, forcing you countinuesly to take premium. You need to understand that there are minors out here whose parents or family members won't pay money to an app. You Removed the queue and the shuffle option which was totally unnecessary and now so many ads. AFTER EVERY SONG YOULL GIVE AN AD!? At this point id rather go to other apps.\"},{\"review_id\":\"bb945b00-6ed7-402a-a834-0b2310333f3f\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing! Premium is 100% WORTH IT!\"},{\"review_id\":\"8603aefe-007f-4857-b6ab-7408ae9066b4\",\"review_text\":\"Works now\"},{\"review_id\":\"57deee5d-6b94-4874-8142-d0b54eaaa914\",\"review_text\":\"If it would have been possible then i would have rated zero. Very disappointing spotify. The new update sucks.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a7fe8bea-09df-47cc-ab10-707aa6ba21c8\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing aap good working\"},{\"review_id\":\"9feb324c-f2df-4734-b36c-a1a10178d666\",\"review_text\":\"It was a good app but after the update things got bad firstly , I can only spip the songs after an hour and get only six skips , secondly, can't listen to any part of theusic unless you pay , etc\"}]}"
